--- gift_modal_flows_overview
flow_name | client_type | entry_point | modal_type | recipients_loading | key_features
Flujo 1 | Company | app-pdp | gift-modal | Bulk or Manual | Multi-recipient, File upload, Table management
Flujo 2 | Company | Multi-product | gift-modal | Sync per product | localStorage sync, Multiple products, Recipient sum
Flujo 3 | Persons | app-pdp | inline-form | Single + quantity | Inline form, Quantity multiplier, No modal

--- flujo_1_routes
route | step | component | action | validation | result | next_step
Route_A | 3 | app-file-dropzone | Upload CSV/XLSX | onConfirmValidData | File validated or errors shown | 4 or stay
Route_A | 4 | app-validation-errors | Review errors | User corrects | Show error details or modal | Continue or Retry
Route_A | 5 | app-manual-entry | Edit/Delete rows | Checkbox actions | Row management enabled | Save or Review
Route_B | 3 | manual-entry | Select manual option | N/A | Show table view | 4
Route_B | 4 | app-gift-form-individually | Fill form fields | Field validation | Form validated | 5 or add more
Common | 5 | app-manual-entry | Review & Save | N/A | Modal closes | 6

--- flujo_1_components_interaction
from_component | to_component | action | data_flow | condition | result
app-pdp | app-gift-pdp | toggleGiftForm() | N/A | User clicks Send Gift | Open gift modal
app-file-dropzone | app-progress-bar | File upload valid | File data | CSV/XLSX valid | Show progress
app-progress-bar | button | Enable state | N/A | Upload complete | Enable load button
app-manual-entry | app-gift-pdp | Save recipients | Recipients array | All validation passed | Close modal
app-gift-pdp | EqualizerPdpComponent | Update quantity | Recipient count | Recipients loaded | Disable selector
app-gift-pdp | minicart | Update badge | Count | Recipients exist | Update counter

--- flujo_1_modal_states
state | visible_component | buttons_visible | buttons_disabled | user_can_do | next_state
Initial | app-file-dropzone | Load button | true | Nothing | Wait for file
File_Valid | app-progress-bar | Load button | false | Click load | Manual entry table
File_Invalid | app-validation-errors | Load button, Retry | false | Click retry or details | File dropzone
Manual_Entry | app-manual-entry | Save button | false | Edit, Delete, Select | Final review
Manual_Adding | app-gift-form-individually | Save button | N/A | Fill form, Add more | Manual entry
Final_Review | app-manual-entry | Save button | false | Confirm save | Close modal

--- flujo_1_critical_rules
rule_id | rule_description | applies_to | enforce | impact_if_violated
RULE_1 | EqualizerPdpComponent MUST be disabled | Route A & B final | Critical | User could alter quantity incorrectly
RULE_2 | localStorage key MUST NOT overwrite cart | Save action | Critical | Cart data corruption
RULE_3 | Recipients must be summed not replaced | Save action | Critical | Previous recipients lost
RULE_4 | Add Users button hidden in table | Route A | High | UX confusion
RULE_5 | Bulk file validation before load | Route A step 3 | High | Invalid data in system
RULE_6 | Checkbox select all must enable bulk actions | Manual entry | Medium | Users cannot bulk edit

--- flujo_1_validation_rules
validation_point | triggers_at | checks | pass_condition | fail_condition | error_component
File_Upload | Route A step 3 | CSV/XLSX format, columns, data types | All checks pass | Any check fails | app-validation-errors
Field_Fill | Route B step 4 | Required fields, email format | All required filled | Missing or invalid | Form inline validation
Form_Save | Route B step 4 | At least 1 valid form | Form valid | Form empty or invalid | Disable save button
Bulk_Save | Route A step 5 | Recipients exist in table | Table has rows | Table empty | Disable save button
Final_Save | Step 5 common | All validations passed | Validation complete | Any error remains | Keep modal open

--- flujo_2_multiproduct_flow
step | product | action | localStorage_key | recipients_before | recipients_after | sync_logic
1 | Product A | Load recipients | voucher-order-form | 0 | N recipients | Store Product A + recipients
2 | Product B navigation | User navigates | N/A | N | N | Maintain Product A data
3 | Product B load | Load recipients | voucher-order-form | N (from A) | N + M | SUM recipients, add Product B
Final | Both products | Review cart | voucher-order-form | N + M | N + M | Both products with their recipients

--- flujo_2_sync_critical_points
sync_point | operation | current_state | new_data | operation_type | result_state | risk_if_wrong
Save_Product_A | Store | Empty | RecipientSet_A | Add | [ProductA: RecipientSet_A] | N/A
Retrieve_Before_ProductB | Get | [ProductA: Set_A] | N/A | Read | RecipientSet_A loaded | Data loss
Save_Product_B | Combine | [ProductA: Set_A] | RecipientSet_B | SUM arrays | [ProductA: Set_A, ProductB: Set_B] | ProductA lost
Final_Checkout | Process | [ProductA: Set_A, ProductB: Set_B] | N/A | Read | Both items in order | Incomplete order

--- flujo_3_persons_flow
step | component | action | form_state | selector_state | minicart_state | next_step
1 | app-pdp | User lands | Hidden | Default value | 0 | 2
2 | app-gift-pdp | Expand form | Visible (inline) | Default value | 0 | 3
3 | app-gift-form | Fill form + Save | Completed | Quantity = 1 ENABLED | 1 | 4
4 | Selector | User increases qty | N/A | Quantity increases (2,3...) | Updates to new qty | Store update
5 | localStorage | Save state | N/A | N/A | N/A | Final state

--- flujo_3_quantity_logic
scenario | action_by_user | quantity_change | recipients_count | meaning | storage_impact
After_Save | N/A | 1 | 1 recipient | One person loaded | Store 1 recipient
Increase_to_2 | Click (+) selector | 1 → 2 | Still 1 recipient | 2 bonos for same person | Update quantity field only
Increase_to_3 | Click (+) selector | 2 → 3 | Still 1 recipient | 3 bonos for same person | Update quantity field only
Decrease_to_1 | Click (-) selector | 2 → 1 | Still 1 recipient | 1 bono for same person | Update quantity field only

--- flujo_3_ui_differences
ui_element | flujo_1_company | flujo_2_multiproduct | flujo_3_persons | key_difference
Modal_Type | Full modal | Full modal | Inline form | Modal vs Inline
Recipients | Multiple allowed | Multiple per product | Single person | Quantity controls recipient
Selector_State | DISABLED after load | DISABLED per product | ALWAYS ENABLED | Persons can adjust quantity
Add_Users_Button | Visible in manual | Visible in manual | N/A | Only for bulk flows
Quantity_Meaning | N/A | N/A | Bonos per person | Different semantics
localStorage_Key | voucher-order-form | voucher-order-form | voucher-order-form | Same key, different logic

--- key_components_summary
component_name | file_pattern | responsibility | appears_in_flows | critical_role
app-pdp | app-pdp.component.ts | Product display page | All flows | Entry point
app-gift-pdp | app-gift-pdp.component.ts | Gift form trigger & summary | Flow 1, 3 | Recipient summary display
app-gift-modal | app-gift-modal.component.ts | Modal container | Flow 1, 2 | Route navigation (A/B)
app-file-dropzone | app-file-dropzone.component.ts | File upload | Flow 1 Route A | File validation entry
app-validation-errors | app-validation-errors.component.ts | Error display | Flow 1 Route A | Error feedback
app-manual-entry | app-manual-entry.component.ts | Table/grid view | Flow 1 Route A & B | Final recipient review
app-gift-form-individually | app-gift-form-individually.component.ts | Individual form | Flow 1 Route B | Form-based entry
app-gift-form | app-gift-form.component.ts | Inline form | Flow 3 | Inline persons entry
EqualizerPdpComponent | equalizer-pdp.component.ts | Quantity selector | Flow 1 & 3 | CRITICAL: Must disable when recipients exist
progress-bar | app-progress-bar.component.ts | Upload progress | Flow 1 Route A | Visual feedback
minicart | minicart.component.ts | Cart counter | All flows | Badge update

--- storage_operations
operation | flow | step | key | action | data_structure | overwrites | appends
Save_Recipients_A | Flow 1 | 5 | voucher-order-form | setRecipients() | [Recipients] | Current flow only | No
Retrieve_Cart | Flow 2 | 4 | voucher-order-form | Get current | [Items] | N/A | Check before sum
Save_Recipients_B | Flow 2 | 4 | voucher-order-form | SUM with existing | [ItemA, ItemB] | No - APPEND | Yes
Save_Quantity | Flow 3 | 4 | voucher-order-form | Update quantity field | { recipient, quantity } | No - UPDATE field | No

--- decision_tree_flow1_validation
question | if_yes | if_no | condition | note
File uploaded? | Validate format | Show error | Always required for Route A | CSV/XLSX
Format valid? | Show progress bar | Show errors component | Validate columns & types | onConfirmValidData
User clicks load? | Go to table view | Stay at upload | Button enabled after validation | Enable button
Table has data? | Enable save button | Disable save | Check recipients count | Prevent empty save
User confirms save? | Close modal, update PDP | Cancel operation | User action required | Save recipients
